<title>INDIA: Bombay sugar markets shut for second day.</title>
<headline>Bombay sugar markets shut for second day.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombay sugar markets were shut for the second successive day on Thursday as traders observed a strike to protest a government tax hike, dealers said.</p>
<p>It will reopen for trading on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Commodities +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
